{"pdf_page": 80, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "帝纪第四", "bbox": [107.58, 118.954, 211.859, 144.934], "kind": "heading", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 4}
{"pdf_page": 80, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "明帝", "bbox": [50.22, 193.82, 86.22, 211.82], "kind": "heading", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 8}
{"pdf_page": 80, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "世宗明皇帝讳毓，小名统万突，", "bbox": [50.22, 229.34, 305.332, 247.34], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 26}
{"pdf_page": 80, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "太祖长子也。母曰姚夫人。永熙三", "bbox": [14.22, 256.826, 305.262, 274.826], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 41}
{"pdf_page": 80, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "年，太祖临夏州，生帝于统万城，因", "bbox": [14.22, 284.366, 305.271, 302.366], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 57}
{"pdf_page": 80, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "以名焉。大统十四年，封宁都郡公。", "bbox": [14.22, 311.852, 305.271, 329.852], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 73}
{"pdf_page": 80, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "十六年，行华州事。寻拜开府仪同三", "bbox": [14.22, 339.338, 305.271, 357.338], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 89}
{"pdf_page": 80, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "司、宜州诸军事、宜州刺史。魏恭帝", "bbox": [14.22, 366.878, 305.271, 384.878], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 105}
{"pdf_page": 80, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "三年，授大将军，镇陇右。孝闵帝践", "bbox": [14.22, 394.364, 305.271, 412.364], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 121}
{"pdf_page": 80, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "阼，进位柱国，转岐州诸军事、岐州", "bbox": [14.22, 421.85, 305.271, 439.85], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 121, "char_end": 137}
{"pdf_page": 81, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "刺史。治有美政，黎民怀之。", "bbox": [14.22, 39.861, 248.22, 57.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 150}
{"pdf_page": 81, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "及孝闵帝废，晋公护遣使迎帝于", "bbox": [50.22, 75.321, 305.332, 93.321], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 168}
{"pdf_page": 81, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "岐州。秋九月癸亥，至京师，止于旧", "bbox": [14.22, 102.861, 305.271, 120.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 168, "char_end": 184}
{"pdf_page": 81, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "邸。甲子，群臣上表劝进，备法驾奉", "bbox": [14.22, 130.347, 305.271, 148.347], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 200}
{"pdf_page": 81, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "迎。帝固让，群臣固请。是日，即天", "bbox": [14.22, 157.833, 305.271, 175.833], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 200, "char_end": 216}
{"pdf_page": 81, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "王位，大赦天下。乙丑，朝群臣于延", "bbox": [14.22, 185.373, 305.271, 203.373], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 232}
{"pdf_page": 81, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "寿殿。", "bbox": [14.22, 212.859, 68.22, 230.859], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 232, "char_end": 235}
{"pdf_page": 81, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "冬十月癸酉，太师、赵国公李弼", "bbox": [50.22, 248.303, 305.332, 266.303], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 239, "char_end": 253}
{"pdf_page": 81, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "薨。己卯，以大将军、昌平公尉迟纲", "bbox": [14.22, 275.843, 305.271, 293.843], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 253, "char_end": 269}
{"pdf_page": 81, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "为柱国。乙酉，祠圆丘。丙戌，祠方", "bbox": [14.22, 303.329, 305.271, 321.329], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 285}
{"pdf_page": 81, "pdf_line": 12, "text": "丘。甲午，祠太社。柱国、阳平公李", "bbox": [14.22, 330.869, 305.271, 348.869], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 285, "char_end": 301}
{"pdf_page": 81, "pdf_line": 13, "text": "远赐死。是月，梁相陈霸先废其主萧", "bbox": [14.22, 358.355, 305.271, 376.355], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 301, "char_end": 317}
{"pdf_page": 81, "pdf_line": 14, "text": "方智而自立，是为陈武帝。十一月庚", "bbox": [14.22, 385.841, 305.271, 403.841], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 317, "char_end": 333}
{"pdf_page": 81, "pdf_line": 15, "text": "子，祠太庙。丁未，祠圆丘。丁巳，", "bbox": [14.22, 413.381, 305.271, 431.381], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 333, "char_end": 349}
{"pdf_page": 81, "pdf_line": 16, "text": "诏曰：“帝王之道，以宽仁为大。魏", "bbox": [14.22, 440.867, 305.271, 458.867], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 349, "char_end": 365}
{"pdf_page": 82, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "政诸有轻犯未至重罪、及诸村民一家", "bbox": [14.22, 39.861, 305.271, 57.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 365, "char_end": 381}
{"pdf_page": 82, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "有犯乃及数家而被远配者，并宜放", "bbox": [14.22, 67.347, 305.262, 85.347], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 381, "char_end": 396}
{"pdf_page": 82, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "还。”十二月庚午，谒成陵。癸酉，", "bbox": [14.22, 94.833, 305.271, 112.833], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 396, "char_end": 412}
{"pdf_page": 82, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "还宫。庚辰，以大将军、辅城公邕为", "bbox": [14.22, 122.373, 305.271, 140.373], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 412, "char_end": 428}
{"pdf_page": 82, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "柱国。戊子，赦长安见囚。甲午，诏", "bbox": [14.22, 149.859, 305.271, 167.859], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 428, "char_end": 444}
{"pdf_page": 82, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "曰：“善人之后，犹累世获宥，况魏", "bbox": [14.22, 177.345, 305.271, 195.345], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 444, "char_end": 460}
{"pdf_page": 82, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "氏以德让代终，岂容不加隐恤。元氏", "bbox": [14.22, 204.885, 305.271, 222.885], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 476}
{"pdf_page": 82, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "子女自坐赵贵等事以来，所有没入为", "bbox": [14.22, 232.371, 305.271, 250.371], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 476, "char_end": 492}
{"pdf_page": 82, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "官口者，悉宜放免。”", "bbox": [14.22, 259.857, 194.22, 277.857], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 492, "char_end": 502}
{"pdf_page": 82, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "二年春正月乙未，以大冢宰、晋", "bbox": [50.22, 295.344, 305.332, 313.344], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 506, "char_end": 520}
{"pdf_page": 82, "pdf_line": 12, "text": "公护为太师。辛亥，亲耕籍田。癸", "bbox": [14.22, 322.83, 305.262, 340.83], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 520, "char_end": 535}
{"pdf_page": 82, "pdf_line": 13, "text": "丑，立王后独孤氏。丁巳。雍州置十", "bbox": [14.22, 350.37, 305.271, 368.37], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 535, "char_end": 551}
{"pdf_page": 82, "pdf_line": 14, "text": "二郡。又于河东置蒲州，河北置虞", "bbox": [14.22, 377.856, 305.262, 395.856], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 551, "char_end": 566}
{"pdf_page": 82, "pdf_line": 15, "text": "州，弘农置陕州，正平置绛州，宜阳", "bbox": [14.22, 405.342, 305.271, 423.342], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 566, "char_end": 582}
{"pdf_page": 82, "pdf_line": 16, "text": "置熊州，邵郡置邵州。", "bbox": [14.22, 432.882, 194.22, 450.882], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 582, "char_end": 592}
{"pdf_page": 83, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "二月癸未，诏曰：“王者之宰民", "bbox": [50.22, 39.801, 305.332, 57.801], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 596, "char_end": 610}
{"pdf_page": 83, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "也，莫不同四海，一远近，为父母而", "bbox": [14.22, 67.341, 305.271, 85.341], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 610, "char_end": 626}
{"pdf_page": 83, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "子之。一物失所，若纳于隍。贼之境", "bbox": [14.22, 94.827, 305.271, 112.827], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 626, "char_end": 642}
{"pdf_page": 83, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "土，本同大化。往因时难，致阻东", "bbox": [14.22, 122.367, 305.262, 140.367], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 642, "char_end": 657}
{"pdf_page": 83, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "西。遂使疆埸之间，互相抄掠。兴言", "bbox": [14.22, 149.853, 305.271, 167.853], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 657, "char_end": 673}
{"pdf_page": 83, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "及此，良可哀伤。自元年以来，有被", "bbox": [14.22, 177.339, 305.271, 195.339], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 673, "char_end": 689}
{"pdf_page": 83, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "掠入贼者，悉可放免。”自冬不雨，", "bbox": [14.22, 204.879, 305.271, 222.879], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 689, "char_end": 705}
{"pdf_page": 83, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "至于是月方大雪。三月甲午，齐北豫", "bbox": [14.22, 232.365, 305.271, 250.365], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 705, "char_end": 721}
{"pdf_page": 83, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "州刺史司马消难举州来附，遣柱国、", "bbox": [14.22, 259.851, 305.271, 277.851], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 721, "char_end": 737}
{"pdf_page": 83, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "高阳公达奚武与大将军杨忠率众迎", "bbox": [14.22, 287.391, 305.262, 305.391], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 737, "char_end": 752}
{"pdf_page": 83, "pdf_line": 12, "text": "之。改雍州刺史为雍州牧，京兆郡守", "bbox": [14.22, 314.877, 305.271, 332.877], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 752, "char_end": 768}
{"pdf_page": 83, "pdf_line": 13, "text": "为京兆尹。以广业、修城二郡置康", "bbox": [14.22, 342.363, 305.262, 360.363], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 768, "char_end": 783}
{"pdf_page": 83, "pdf_line": 14, "text": "州，葭芦郡置文州。戊申，长安献白", "bbox": [14.22, 369.903, 305.271, 387.903], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 783, "char_end": 799}
{"pdf_page": 83, "pdf_line": 15, "text": "雀。庚申，诏曰：“三十六国，九十", "bbox": [14.22, 397.389, 305.271, 415.389], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 799, "char_end": 815}
{"pdf_page": 83, "pdf_line": 16, "text": "九姓，自魏氏南徙，皆称河南之民。", "bbox": [14.22, 424.875, 305.271, 442.875], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 815, "char_end": 831}
{"pdf_page": 84, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "今周室既都关中，宜改称京兆人。”", "bbox": [14.22, 39.861, 302.22, 57.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 831, "char_end": 847}
{"pdf_page": 84, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "夏四月己巳，以太师、晋公护为", "bbox": [50.22, 75.321, 305.332, 93.321], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 851, "char_end": 865}
{"pdf_page": 84, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "雍州牧。庚午，荧惑入轩辕。辛未，", "bbox": [14.22, 102.861, 305.271, 120.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 865, "char_end": 881}
{"pdf_page": 84, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "降死罪一等，五岁刑已下皆原之。甲", "bbox": [14.22, 130.347, 305.271, 148.347], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 881, "char_end": 897}
{"pdf_page": 84, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "戌，王后独孤氏崩。甲申，葬敬后。", "bbox": [14.22, 157.833, 305.271, 175.833], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 897, "char_end": 913}
{"pdf_page": 84, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "五月乙未，以大司空、梁国公侯莫陈", "bbox": [14.22, 185.373, 305.271, 203.373], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 913, "char_end": 929}
{"pdf_page": 84, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "崇为大宗伯。六月癸亥，囐哒遣使献", "bbox": [14.22, 212.859, 305.271, 230.859], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 929, "char_end": 945}
{"pdf_page": 84, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "方物。己巳，板授高年刺史、守、", "bbox": [14.22, 240.345, 305.262, 258.345], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 945, "char_end": 960}
{"pdf_page": 84, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "令，恤鳏寡孤独各有差。分长安为万", "bbox": [14.22, 267.885, 305.271, 285.885], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 960, "char_end": 976}
{"pdf_page": 84, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "年县，并治京城。辛未，幸昆明池。", "bbox": [14.22, 295.371, 305.271, 313.371], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 976, "char_end": 992}
{"pdf_page": 84, "pdf_line": 12, "text": "壬申，长安献白乌。遣使分行州郡，", "bbox": [14.22, 322.857, 305.271, 340.857], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 992, "char_end": 1008}
{"pdf_page": 84, "pdf_line": 13, "text": "理囚徒，察风俗，掩骼埋胔。秋七月", "bbox": [14.22, 350.397, 305.271, 368.397], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1008, "char_end": 1024}
{"pdf_page": 84, "pdf_line": 14, "text": "甲午，遣柱国、宁蜀公尉迟迥率众于", "bbox": [14.22, 377.883, 305.271, 395.883], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1024, "char_end": 1040}
{"pdf_page": 84, "pdf_line": 15, "text": "河南筑安乐城。丙申，顺阳献三足", "bbox": [14.22, 405.369, 305.262, 423.369], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1040, "char_end": 1055}
{"pdf_page": 84, "pdf_line": 16, "text": "乌。八月甲子，群臣上表称庆。诏", "bbox": [14.22, 432.909, 305.262, 450.909], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1055, "char_end": 1070}
{"pdf_page": 85, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "曰：“夫天不爱宝，地称表瑞，莫不", "bbox": [14.22, 39.861, 305.271, 57.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1070, "char_end": 1086}
{"pdf_page": 85, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "威凤巢阁，图龙跃沼，岂直日月珠", "bbox": [14.22, 67.347, 305.262, 85.347], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1086, "char_end": 1101}
{"pdf_page": 85, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "连，风雨玉烛。是以《钩命决》曰", "bbox": [14.22, 94.833, 305.262, 112.833], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1101, "char_end": 1116}
{"pdf_page": 85, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "‘王者至孝则出’。", "bbox": [14.22, 122.373, 176.22, 140.373], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1116, "char_end": 1125}
{"pdf_page": 85, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "《元命苞》曰‘人君至治所", "bbox": [50.22, 157.822, 305.325, 175.822], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1129, "char_end": 1141}
{"pdf_page": 85, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "有’。虞舜烝烝，来兹异趾；周文翼", "bbox": [14.22, 185.362, 305.271, 203.362], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1141, "char_end": 1157}
{"pdf_page": 85, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "翼，翔此灵禽。文考至德下覃，遗仁", "bbox": [14.22, 212.848, 305.271, 230.848], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1157, "char_end": 1173}
{"pdf_page": 85, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "爱被，远符千载，降斯三足。将使三", "bbox": [14.22, 240.334, 305.271, 258.334], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1173, "char_end": 1189}
{"pdf_page": 85, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "方归本，九州翕定。惟此大体，景福", "bbox": [14.22, 267.874, 305.271, 285.874], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1189, "char_end": 1205}
{"pdf_page": 85, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "在民。予安敢让宗庙之善，弗宣大", "bbox": [14.22, 295.36, 305.262, 313.36], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1205, "char_end": 1220}
{"pdf_page": 85, "pdf_line": 12, "text": "惠。可大赦天下，文武官普进二", "bbox": [14.22, 322.846, 305.298, 340.846], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1220, "char_end": 1234}
{"pdf_page": 85, "pdf_line": 13, "text": "级。”九月辛卯，以大将军杨忠、大", "bbox": [14.22, 350.386, 305.271, 368.386], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1234, "char_end": 1250}
{"pdf_page": 85, "pdf_line": 14, "text": "将军王雄，并为柱国。甲辰，封少师", "bbox": [14.22, 377.872, 305.271, 395.872], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1250, "char_end": 1266}
{"pdf_page": 85, "pdf_line": 15, "text": "元罗为韩国公，以绍魏后。丁未，幸", "bbox": [14.22, 405.358, 305.271, 423.358], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1266, "char_end": 1282}
{"pdf_page": 85, "pdf_line": 16, "text": "同州。过故宅，赋诗曰：“玉烛调秋", "bbox": [14.22, 432.898, 305.271, 450.898], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1282, "char_end": 1298}
{"pdf_page": 86, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "气，金舆历旧宫。还如过白水，更似", "bbox": [14.22, 39.861, 305.271, 57.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1298, "char_end": 1314}
{"pdf_page": 86, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "入新丰。霜潭渍晚菊，寒井落疏桐。", "bbox": [14.22, 67.347, 305.271, 85.347], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1314, "char_end": 1330}
{"pdf_page": 86, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "举杯延故老，令闻歌《大风》。”", "bbox": [14.22, 94.833, 284.22, 112.833], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1330, "char_end": 1345}
{"pdf_page": 86, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "冬十月辛酉，还宫。乙丑，遣柱", "bbox": [50.22, 130.342, 305.332, 148.342], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1349, "char_end": 1363}
{"pdf_page": 86, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "国尉迟迥镇陇右。长安献白兔。十二", "bbox": [14.22, 157.828, 305.271, 175.828], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1363, "char_end": 1379}
{"pdf_page": 86, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "月辛酉，突厥遣使献方物。癸亥，太", "bbox": [14.22, 185.368, 305.271, 203.368], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1379, "char_end": 1395}
{"pdf_page": 86, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "庙成。辛已，以功臣琅邪贞献公贺拔", "bbox": [14.22, 212.854, 305.271, 230.854], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1395, "char_end": 1411}
{"pdf_page": 86, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "胜等十三人配享太祖庙庭。壬午，大", "bbox": [14.22, 240.34, 305.271, 258.34], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1411, "char_end": 1427}
{"pdf_page": 86, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "赦天下。", "bbox": [14.22, 267.88, 86.22, 285.88], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1427, "char_end": 1431}
{"pdf_page": 86, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "武成元年春正月乙酉，太师、晋", "bbox": [50.22, 303.323, 305.332, 321.323], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1435, "char_end": 1449}
{"pdf_page": 86, "pdf_line": 12, "text": "公护上表归政，帝始亲览万机。军旅", "bbox": [14.22, 330.863, 305.271, 348.863], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1449, "char_end": 1465}
{"pdf_page": 86, "pdf_line": 13, "text": "之事，护犹总焉。初改都督诸州军事", "bbox": [14.22, 358.349, 305.271, 376.349], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1465, "char_end": 1481}
{"pdf_page": 86, "pdf_line": 14, "text": "为总管。丙辰，封大将军、章武孝公", "bbox": [14.22, 385.835, 305.271, 403.835], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1481, "char_end": 1497}
{"pdf_page": 86, "pdf_line": 15, "text": "导子亮为永昌公，翼为西阳公。三月", "bbox": [14.22, 413.375, 305.271, 431.375], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1497, "char_end": 1513}
{"pdf_page": 86, "pdf_line": 16, "text": "癸巳，陈六军，帝亲擐甲胄，迎太白", "bbox": [14.22, 440.861, 305.271, 458.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1513, "char_end": 1529}
{"pdf_page": 87, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "于东方。秦郡公直镇蒲州。吐谷浑寇", "bbox": [14.22, 39.861, 305.271, 57.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1529, "char_end": 1545}
{"pdf_page": 87, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "边。庚戌，遣大司马、博陵公贺兰祥", "bbox": [14.22, 67.347, 305.271, 85.347], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1545, "char_end": 1561}
{"pdf_page": 87, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "率众讨之。", "bbox": [14.22, 94.833, 104.22, 112.833], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1561, "char_end": 1566}
{"pdf_page": 87, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "四月戊午，武当郡献赤乌。甲", "bbox": [50.22, 130.342, 305.345, 148.342], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1570, "char_end": 1583}
{"pdf_page": 87, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "戌，云。秦州献白马朱鬛。五月戊", "bbox": [14.22, 157.828, 305.262, 175.828], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1583, "char_end": 1598}
{"pdf_page": 87, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "子，诏曰：“皇王之迹不一，因革之", "bbox": [14.22, 185.368, 305.271, 203.368], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1598, "char_end": 1614}
{"pdf_page": 87, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "道已殊，莫不播八政以成物，兆三元", "bbox": [14.22, 212.854, 305.271, 230.854], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1614, "char_end": 1630}
{"pdf_page": 87, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "而为纪。是以容成创定于轩辕，羲和", "bbox": [14.22, 240.34, 305.271, 258.34], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1630, "char_end": 1646}
{"pdf_page": 87, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "钦若于唐世，《鸿范》九畴，大弘五", "bbox": [14.22, 267.88, 305.271, 285.88], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1646, "char_end": 1662}
{"pdf_page": 87, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "法。《易》曰：‘泽中有火，革，君", "bbox": [14.22, 295.366, 305.271, 313.366], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1662, "char_end": 1678}
{"pdf_page": 87, "pdf_line": 12, "text": "子以治历明时。’故历之为义大矣。", "bbox": [14.22, 322.852, 305.271, 340.852], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1678, "char_end": 1694}
{"pdf_page": 87, "pdf_line": 13, "text": "但忽微成象，象极则差；分积命时，", "bbox": [14.22, 350.392, 305.271, 368.392], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1694, "char_end": 1710}
{"pdf_page": 87, "pdf_line": 14, "text": "时积斯舛。开辟至于获麟，二百七十", "bbox": [14.22, 377.878, 305.271, 395.878], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1710, "char_end": 1726}
{"pdf_page": 87, "pdf_line": 15, "text": "六万岁，晷度推移，余分盈缩，南正", "bbox": [14.22, 405.364, 305.271, 423.364], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1726, "char_end": 1742}
{"pdf_page": 87, "pdf_line": 16, "text": "无闻，畴人靡记。暑往寒来，理乖攸", "bbox": [14.22, 432.904, 305.271, 450.904], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1742, "char_end": 1758}
{"pdf_page": 88, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "序，敬授民时，何其积谬。昔汉世巴", "bbox": [14.22, 39.861, 305.271, 57.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1758, "char_end": 1774}
{"pdf_page": 88, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "郡洛下闳善治历，云后八百岁，当有", "bbox": [14.22, 67.347, 305.271, 85.347], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1774, "char_end": 1790}
{"pdf_page": 88, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "圣人定之。自火行至今，木德应其运", "bbox": [14.22, 94.833, 305.271, 112.833], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1790, "char_end": 1806}
{"pdf_page": 88, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "矣，朕何让焉。可命有司，傍稽六", "bbox": [14.22, 122.373, 305.262, 140.373], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1806, "char_end": 1821}
{"pdf_page": 88, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "历，仰观七曜，博推古今，造我周", "bbox": [14.22, 149.859, 305.262, 167.859], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1821, "char_end": 1836}
{"pdf_page": 88, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "历，量定以闻。”己亥，听讼于正武", "bbox": [14.22, 177.345, 305.271, 195.345], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1836, "char_end": 1852}
{"pdf_page": 88, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "殿。辛亥，以大宗伯、梁国公侯莫陈", "bbox": [14.22, 204.885, 305.271, 222.885], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1852, "char_end": 1868}
{"pdf_page": 88, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "崇为大司徒，大司寇、高阳公达奚武", "bbox": [14.22, 232.371, 305.271, 250.371], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1868, "char_end": 1884}
{"pdf_page": 88, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "为大宗伯，武阳公豆卢宁为大司寇，", "bbox": [14.22, 259.857, 305.271, 277.857], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1884, "char_end": 1900}
{"pdf_page": 88, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "柱国、辅城公邕为大司空。乙卯，诏", "bbox": [14.22, 287.397, 305.271, 305.397], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1900, "char_end": 1916}
{"pdf_page": 88, "pdf_line": 12, "text": "曰：", "bbox": [14.22, 314.883, 50.22, 332.883], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1916, "char_end": 1918}
{"pdf_page": 88, "pdf_line": 13, "text": "“比屡有纠发官司赦前事。此虽", "bbox": [50.22, 350.305, 305.332, 368.305], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1922, "char_end": 1936}
{"pdf_page": 88, "pdf_line": 14, "text": "意在疾恶，但先王制肆眚之道，令天", "bbox": [14.22, 377.845, 305.271, 395.845], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1936, "char_end": 1952}
{"pdf_page": 88, "pdf_line": 15, "text": "下自新。若又推问，自新何由哉。如", "bbox": [14.22, 405.331, 305.271, 423.331], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1952, "char_end": 1968}
{"pdf_page": 88, "pdf_line": 16, "text": "此之徒，有司勿为推究。惟库厩仓廪", "bbox": [14.22, 432.871, 305.271, 450.871], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1968, "char_end": 1984}
{"pdf_page": 89, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "与海内所共，汉帝有云‘朕为天下守", "bbox": [14.22, 39.861, 305.271, 57.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 1984, "char_end": 2000}
{"pdf_page": 89, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "财耳’。若有侵盗公家财畜钱粟者，", "bbox": [14.22, 67.347, 305.271, 85.347], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2000, "char_end": 2016}
{"pdf_page": 89, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "魏朝之事，年月既远，一不须问。自", "bbox": [14.22, 94.833, 305.271, 112.833], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2016, "char_end": 2032}
{"pdf_page": 89, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "周有天下以来，虽经赦宥，而事迹可", "bbox": [14.22, 122.373, 305.271, 140.373], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2032, "char_end": 2048}
{"pdf_page": 89, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "知者，有司宜即推穷。得实之日，但", "bbox": [14.22, 149.859, 305.271, 167.859], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2048, "char_end": 2064}
{"pdf_page": 89, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "免其罪，征备如法。”贺兰祥攻拔洮", "bbox": [14.22, 177.345, 305.271, 195.345], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2064, "char_end": 2080}
{"pdf_page": 89, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "阳、洪和二城，吐谷浑遁走。闰月庚", "bbox": [14.22, 204.885, 305.271, 222.885], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2080, "char_end": 2096}
{"pdf_page": 89, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "申，高昌遣使献方物。", "bbox": [14.22, 232.371, 194.22, 250.371], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2096, "char_end": 2106}
{"pdf_page": 89, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "六月戊子，大雨霖。诏曰：“昔", "bbox": [50.22, 267.804, 305.332, 285.804], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2110, "char_end": 2124}
{"pdf_page": 89, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "唐咨四岳，殷告六眚，睹灾兴惧，咸", "bbox": [14.22, 295.344, 305.271, 313.344], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2124, "char_end": 2140}
{"pdf_page": 89, "pdf_line": 12, "text": "置时雍。朕抚运应图，作民父母，弗", "bbox": [14.22, 322.83, 305.271, 340.83], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2140, "char_end": 2156}
{"pdf_page": 89, "pdf_line": 13, "text": "敢怠荒，以求民瘼。而霖雨作沴，害", "bbox": [14.22, 350.37, 305.271, 368.37], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2156, "char_end": 2172}
{"pdf_page": 89, "pdf_line": 14, "text": "麦伤苗，隤屋漂垣，洎于昏垫。谅朕", "bbox": [14.22, 377.856, 305.271, 395.856], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2172, "char_end": 2188}
{"pdf_page": 89, "pdf_line": 15, "text": "不德，苍生何咎？刑政所失，罔识厥", "bbox": [14.22, 405.342, 305.271, 423.342], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2188, "char_end": 2204}
{"pdf_page": 89, "pdf_line": 16, "text": "由。公卿大夫士爰及牧守黎庶等，今", "bbox": [14.22, 432.882, 305.271, 450.882], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2204, "char_end": 2220}
{"pdf_page": 90, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "宜各上封事，谠言极谏，罔有所讳。", "bbox": [14.22, 39.861, 305.271, 57.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2220, "char_end": 2236}
{"pdf_page": 90, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "朕将览察，以答天谴。其遭水者，有", "bbox": [14.22, 67.347, 305.271, 85.347], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2236, "char_end": 2252}
{"pdf_page": 90, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "司可时巡检，条列以闻。”庚子，诏", "bbox": [14.22, 94.833, 305.271, 112.833], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2252, "char_end": 2268}
{"pdf_page": 90, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "曰：“颍川从我，是曰元勋；无忘父", "bbox": [14.22, 122.373, 305.271, 140.373], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2268, "char_end": 2284}
{"pdf_page": 90, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "城，实起王业。文考属天地草昧，造", "bbox": [14.22, 149.859, 305.271, 167.859], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2284, "char_end": 2300}
{"pdf_page": 90, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "化权舆，拯彼横流，匡兹颓运。赖英", "bbox": [14.22, 177.345, 305.271, 195.345], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2300, "char_end": 2316}
{"pdf_page": 90, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "贤尽力，文武同心，翼赞大功，克隆", "bbox": [14.22, 204.885, 305.271, 222.885], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2316, "char_end": 2332}
{"pdf_page": 90, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "帝业。而被坚执锐，栉风沐雨，永言", "bbox": [14.22, 232.371, 305.271, 250.371], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2332, "char_end": 2348}
{"pdf_page": 90, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "畴昔，良用怃然。", "bbox": [14.22, 259.857, 158.22, 277.857], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2348, "char_end": 2356}
{"pdf_page": 90, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "至若功成名遂，建国剖符，予惟", "bbox": [50.22, 295.344, 305.332, 313.344], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2360, "char_end": 2374}
{"pdf_page": 90, "pdf_line": 12, "text": "休也。其有致死王事，妻子无归者，", "bbox": [14.22, 322.83, 305.271, 340.83], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2374, "char_end": 2390}
{"pdf_page": 90, "pdf_line": 13, "text": "朕甚伤之。凡是从先王向夏州，发夏", "bbox": [14.22, 350.37, 305.271, 368.37], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2390, "char_end": 2406}
{"pdf_page": 90, "pdf_line": 14, "text": "州从来，见在及薨亡者，并量赐钱", "bbox": [14.22, 377.856, 305.262, 395.856], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2406, "char_end": 2421}
{"pdf_page": 90, "pdf_line": 15, "text": "帛，称朕意焉。”是月，陈武帝薨，", "bbox": [14.22, 405.342, 305.271, 423.342], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2421, "char_end": 2437}
{"pdf_page": 90, "pdf_line": 16, "text": "兄子蒨立，是谓文帝。", "bbox": [14.22, 432.882, 194.22, 450.882], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2437, "char_end": 2447}
{"pdf_page": 91, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "秋八月己亥，改天王称皇帝，追", "bbox": [50.22, 39.801, 305.332, 57.801], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2451, "char_end": 2465}
{"pdf_page": 91, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "尊文王为帝，大赦改元。壬子，以大", "bbox": [14.22, 67.341, 305.271, 85.341], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2465, "char_end": 2481}
{"pdf_page": 91, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "将军、安城公宪为益州总管。癸丑，", "bbox": [14.22, 94.827, 305.271, 112.827], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2481, "char_end": 2497}
{"pdf_page": 91, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "增御正四人，位上大夫。九月乙卯，", "bbox": [14.22, 122.367, 305.271, 140.367], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2497, "char_end": 2513}
{"pdf_page": 91, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "以大将军、天水公广为梁州总管。辛", "bbox": [14.22, 149.853, 305.271, 167.853], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2513, "char_end": 2529}
{"pdf_page": 91, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "未，进封辅城公邕为鲁国公，安城公", "bbox": [14.22, 177.339, 305.271, 195.339], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2529, "char_end": 2545}
{"pdf_page": 91, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "宪为齐国公，秦郡公直为卫国公，正", "bbox": [14.22, 204.879, 305.271, 222.879], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2545, "char_end": 2561}
{"pdf_page": 91, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "平公招为赵国公。封皇弟俭为谯国", "bbox": [14.22, 232.365, 305.262, 250.365], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2561, "char_end": 2576}
{"pdf_page": 91, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "公，纯为陈国公，盛为越国公，达为", "bbox": [14.22, 259.851, 305.271, 277.851], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2576, "char_end": 2592}
{"pdf_page": 91, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "代国公，通为冀国公，逌为滕国公。", "bbox": [14.22, 287.391, 305.271, 305.391], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2592, "char_end": 2608}
{"pdf_page": 91, "pdf_line": 12, "text": "进封天水公广为蔡国公，高阳公达奚", "bbox": [14.22, 314.877, 305.271, 332.877], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2608, "char_end": 2624}
{"pdf_page": 91, "pdf_line": 13, "text": "武为郑国公，武阳公豆卢宁为楚国", "bbox": [14.22, 342.363, 305.262, 360.363], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2624, "char_end": 2639}
{"pdf_page": 91, "pdf_line": 14, "text": "公，博陵公贺兰祥为凉国公，宁蜀公", "bbox": [14.22, 369.903, 305.271, 387.903], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2639, "char_end": 2655}
{"pdf_page": 91, "pdf_line": 15, "text": "尉迟迥为蜀国公，化政公宇文贵为许", "bbox": [14.22, 397.389, 305.271, 415.389], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2655, "char_end": 2671}
{"pdf_page": 91, "pdf_line": 16, "text": "国公，陈留公杨忠为随国公，昌平公", "bbox": [14.22, 424.875, 305.271, 442.875], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2671, "char_end": 2687}
{"pdf_page": 92, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "尉迟纲为吴国公，武威公王雄为庸国", "bbox": [14.22, 39.861, 305.271, 57.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2687, "char_end": 2703}
{"pdf_page": 92, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "公。邑各万户。冬十月甲午，以柱", "bbox": [14.22, 67.347, 305.262, 85.347], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2703, "char_end": 2718}
{"pdf_page": 92, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "国、吴国公尉迟纲为泾州总管。是", "bbox": [14.22, 94.833, 305.262, 112.833], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2718, "char_end": 2733}
{"pdf_page": 92, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "月，齐文宣帝薨，子殷嗣立。以柱", "bbox": [14.22, 122.373, 305.262, 140.373], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2733, "char_end": 2748}
{"pdf_page": 92, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "国、蜀国公尉迟迥为秦州总管。二年", "bbox": [14.22, 149.859, 305.271, 167.859], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2748, "char_end": 2764}
{"pdf_page": 92, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "春正月癸丑朔，大会群臣于紫极殿，", "bbox": [14.22, 177.345, 305.271, 195.345], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2764, "char_end": 2780}
{"pdf_page": 92, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "始用百戏焉。三月辛酉，重阳阁成，", "bbox": [14.22, 204.885, 305.271, 222.885], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2780, "char_end": 2796}
{"pdf_page": 92, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "会群公列将卿大夫及突厥使者于芳林", "bbox": [14.22, 232.371, 305.271, 250.371], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2796, "char_end": 2812}
{"pdf_page": 92, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "园，赐钱帛各有差。夏四月，帝因食", "bbox": [14.22, 259.857, 305.271, 277.857], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2812, "char_end": 2828}
{"pdf_page": 92, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "遇毒。庚子，大渐。诏曰：", "bbox": [14.22, 287.397, 230.22, 305.397], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2828, "char_end": 2840}
{"pdf_page": 92, "pdf_line": 12, "text": "人生天地之间，禀五常之气，天", "bbox": [50.22, 322.825, 305.332, 340.825], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2844, "char_end": 2858}
{"pdf_page": 92, "pdf_line": 13, "text": "地有穷已，五常有推移，人安得长", "bbox": [14.22, 350.365, 305.262, 368.365], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2858, "char_end": 2873}
{"pdf_page": 92, "pdf_line": 14, "text": "在。是以生而有死者，物理之必然。", "bbox": [14.22, 377.851, 305.271, 395.851], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2873, "char_end": 2889}
{"pdf_page": 92, "pdf_line": 15, "text": "处必然之理，修短之间，何足多恨。", "bbox": [14.22, 405.337, 305.271, 423.337], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2889, "char_end": 2905}
{"pdf_page": 92, "pdf_line": 16, "text": "朕虽不德，性好典坟，披览圣贤余", "bbox": [14.22, 432.877, 305.262, 450.877], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2905, "char_end": 2920}
{"pdf_page": 93, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "论，未尝不以此自晓。今乃命也，夫", "bbox": [14.22, 39.861, 305.271, 57.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2920, "char_end": 2936}
{"pdf_page": 93, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "复何言。诸公及在朝卿大夫士，军中", "bbox": [14.22, 67.347, 305.271, 85.347], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2936, "char_end": 2952}
{"pdf_page": 93, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "大小督将、军人等，并立勋效，积有", "bbox": [14.22, 94.833, 305.271, 112.833], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2952, "char_end": 2968}
{"pdf_page": 93, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "年载，辅翼太祖，成我周家。今朕缵", "bbox": [14.22, 122.373, 305.271, 140.373], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2968, "char_end": 2984}
{"pdf_page": 93, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "承大业，处万乘之上，此乃上不负太", "bbox": [14.22, 149.859, 305.271, 167.859], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 2984, "char_end": 3000}
{"pdf_page": 93, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "祖，下不负朕躬。朕得启手启足，从", "bbox": [14.22, 177.345, 305.271, 195.345], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3000, "char_end": 3016}
{"pdf_page": 93, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "先帝于地下，实无恨于心矣。所可恨", "bbox": [14.22, 204.885, 305.271, 222.885], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3016, "char_end": 3032}
{"pdf_page": 93, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "者，朕享大位，可谓四年矣，不能使", "bbox": [14.22, 232.371, 305.271, 250.371], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3032, "char_end": 3048}
{"pdf_page": 93, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "政化循理，黎庶丰足，九州未一，二", "bbox": [14.22, 259.857, 305.271, 277.857], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3048, "char_end": 3064}
{"pdf_page": 93, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "方犹梗。顾此怀归，目用不瞑。唯冀", "bbox": [14.22, 287.397, 305.271, 305.397], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3064, "char_end": 3080}
{"pdf_page": 93, "pdf_line": 12, "text": "仁兄冢宰，洎朕先正、先父、公卿大", "bbox": [14.22, 314.883, 305.271, 332.883], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3080, "char_end": 3096}
{"pdf_page": 93, "pdf_line": 13, "text": "臣等，协和为心，勉力相劝，勿忘太", "bbox": [14.22, 342.369, 305.271, 360.369], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3096, "char_end": 3112}
{"pdf_page": 93, "pdf_line": 14, "text": "祖遗志，提挈后人，朕虽没九泉，形", "bbox": [14.22, 369.909, 305.271, 387.909], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3112, "char_end": 3128}
{"pdf_page": 93, "pdf_line": 15, "text": "体不朽。今大位虚旷，社稷无主。朕", "bbox": [14.22, 397.395, 305.271, 415.395], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3128, "char_end": 3144}
{"pdf_page": 93, "pdf_line": 16, "text": "儿幼稚，未堪当国。鲁国公邕，朕之", "bbox": [14.22, 424.881, 305.271, 442.881], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3144, "char_end": 3160}
{"pdf_page": 94, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "介弟，宽仁大度，海内共闻，能弘我", "bbox": [14.22, 39.861, 305.271, 57.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3160, "char_end": 3176}
{"pdf_page": 94, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "周家，必此子也。夫人贵有始终，公", "bbox": [14.22, 67.347, 305.271, 85.347], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3176, "char_end": 3192}
{"pdf_page": 94, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "等事太祖，辅朕躬，可谓有始矣，若", "bbox": [14.22, 94.833, 305.271, 112.833], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3192, "char_end": 3208}
{"pdf_page": 94, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "克念世道艰难，辅邕以主天下者，可", "bbox": [14.22, 122.373, 305.271, 140.373], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3208, "char_end": 3224}
{"pdf_page": 94, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "谓有终矣。哀死事生，人臣大节。公", "bbox": [14.22, 149.859, 305.271, 167.859], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3224, "char_end": 3240}
{"pdf_page": 94, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "等思念此言，令万代称叹。朕禀生俭", "bbox": [14.22, 177.345, 305.271, 195.345], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3240, "char_end": 3256}
{"pdf_page": 94, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "素，非能力行菲薄，每寝大布之被，", "bbox": [14.22, 204.885, 305.271, 222.885], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3256, "char_end": 3272}
{"pdf_page": 94, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "服大帛之衣，凡是器用，皆无雕刻。", "bbox": [14.22, 232.371, 305.271, 250.371], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3272, "char_end": 3288}
{"pdf_page": 94, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "身终之日，岂容违弃此好。丧事所", "bbox": [14.22, 259.857, 305.262, 277.857], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3288, "char_end": 3303}
{"pdf_page": 94, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "须，务从俭约。敛以时服，勿使有金", "bbox": [14.22, 287.397, 305.271, 305.397], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3303, "char_end": 3319}
{"pdf_page": 94, "pdf_line": 12, "text": "玉之饰。若以礼不可阙，皆令用瓦。", "bbox": [14.22, 314.883, 305.271, 332.883], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3319, "char_end": 3335}
{"pdf_page": 94, "pdf_line": 13, "text": "小敛讫，七日哭。文武百官各权辟衰", "bbox": [14.22, 342.369, 305.271, 360.369], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3335, "char_end": 3351}
{"pdf_page": 94, "pdf_line": 14, "text": "麻，且以素服从事。葬日，选择不毛", "bbox": [14.22, 369.909, 305.271, 387.909], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3351, "char_end": 3367}
{"pdf_page": 94, "pdf_line": 15, "text": "之地，因地势为坟，勿封勿树。且厚", "bbox": [14.22, 397.395, 305.271, 415.395], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3367, "char_end": 3383}
{"pdf_page": 94, "pdf_line": 16, "text": "葬伤生，圣人所诫。朕既服膺圣人之", "bbox": [14.22, 424.881, 305.271, 442.881], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3383, "char_end": 3399}
{"pdf_page": 95, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "教，安敢违之。", "bbox": [14.22, 39.861, 140.22, 57.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3399, "char_end": 3406}
{"pdf_page": 95, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "凡百官司，勿异朕此意。四方州", "bbox": [50.22, 75.321, 305.332, 93.321], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3410, "char_end": 3424}
{"pdf_page": 95, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "镇使到，各令三日哭，哭讫，悉权辟", "bbox": [14.22, 102.861, 305.271, 120.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3424, "char_end": 3440}
{"pdf_page": 95, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "凶服，还以素服从事，待大例除。非", "bbox": [14.22, 130.347, 305.271, 148.347], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3440, "char_end": 3456}
{"pdf_page": 95, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "有呼召，各按部自守，不提辄奔赴阙", "bbox": [14.22, 157.833, 305.271, 175.833], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3456, "char_end": 3472}
{"pdf_page": 95, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "庭。礼有通塞随时之义，葬讫，内外", "bbox": [14.22, 185.373, 305.271, 203.373], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3472, "char_end": 3488}
{"pdf_page": 95, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "悉除服从吉。三年之内，勿禁婚娶，", "bbox": [14.22, 212.859, 305.271, 230.859], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3488, "char_end": 3504}
{"pdf_page": 95, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "饮食一令如平常也。时事殷猥，病困", "bbox": [14.22, 240.345, 305.271, 258.345], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3504, "char_end": 3520}
{"pdf_page": 95, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "心乱，止能及此。如其事有不尽，准", "bbox": [14.22, 267.885, 305.271, 285.885], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3520, "char_end": 3536}
{"pdf_page": 95, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "此以类为断。死而近思，古人有之。", "bbox": [14.22, 295.371, 305.271, 313.371], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3536, "char_end": 3552}
{"pdf_page": 95, "pdf_line": 12, "text": "朕今忍死，书此怀抱。", "bbox": [14.22, 322.857, 194.22, 340.857], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3552, "char_end": 3562}
{"pdf_page": 95, "pdf_line": 13, "text": "其诏即帝口授也。辛丑，崩于延", "bbox": [50.22, 358.344, 305.332, 376.344], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3566, "char_end": 3580}
{"pdf_page": 95, "pdf_line": 14, "text": "寿殿，时年二十七，谥曰明皇帝，庙", "bbox": [14.22, 385.83, 305.271, 403.83], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3580, "char_end": 3596}
{"pdf_page": 95, "pdf_line": 15, "text": "称世宗。五月辛未，葬于昭陵。", "bbox": [14.22, 413.37, 266.22, 431.37], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3596, "char_end": 3610}
{"pdf_page": 96, "pdf_line": 2, "text": "帝宽明仁厚，敦睦九族，有君人", "bbox": [50.22, 39.801, 305.332, 57.801], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3614, "char_end": 3628}
{"pdf_page": 96, "pdf_line": 3, "text": "之量。幼而好学，博览群书，善属", "bbox": [14.22, 67.341, 305.262, 85.341], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3628, "char_end": 3643}
{"pdf_page": 96, "pdf_line": 4, "text": "文，词彩温丽。及即位，集公卿已下", "bbox": [14.22, 94.827, 305.271, 112.827], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3643, "char_end": 3659}
{"pdf_page": 96, "pdf_line": 5, "text": "有文学者八十余人于麟趾殿，刊校经", "bbox": [14.22, 122.367, 305.271, 140.367], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3659, "char_end": 3675}
{"pdf_page": 96, "pdf_line": 6, "text": "史。又捃采众书，自羲、农以来，讫", "bbox": [14.22, 149.853, 305.271, 167.853], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3675, "char_end": 3691}
{"pdf_page": 96, "pdf_line": 7, "text": "于魏末，叙为《世谱》，凡五百卷", "bbox": [14.22, 177.339, 305.262, 195.339], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3691, "char_end": 3706}
{"pdf_page": 96, "pdf_line": 8, "text": "云。所著文章十卷。", "bbox": [14.22, 204.879, 176.22, 222.879], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3706, "char_end": 3715}
{"pdf_page": 96, "pdf_line": 9, "text": "史臣曰：世宗宽仁远度，睿哲博", "bbox": [50.22, 240.323, 305.332, 258.323], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3719, "char_end": 3733}
{"pdf_page": 96, "pdf_line": 10, "text": "闻。处代邸之尊，实文昭之长。豹姿", "bbox": [14.22, 267.863, 305.271, 285.863], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3733, "char_end": 3749}
{"pdf_page": 96, "pdf_line": 11, "text": "已变，龙德犹潜。而百辟倾心，万方", "bbox": [14.22, 295.349, 305.271, 313.349], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3749, "char_end": 3765}
{"pdf_page": 96, "pdf_line": 12, "text": "注意。及乎迎宣黜贺，入纂大宗，而", "bbox": [14.22, 322.835, 305.271, 340.835], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3765, "char_end": 3781}
{"pdf_page": 96, "pdf_line": 13, "text": "礼貌功臣，敦睦九族，率由恭俭，崇", "bbox": [14.22, 350.375, 305.271, 368.375], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3781, "char_end": 3797}
{"pdf_page": 96, "pdf_line": 14, "text": "尚文儒，亹亹焉其有君人之德者矣。", "bbox": [14.22, 377.861, 305.271, 395.861], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3797, "char_end": 3813}
{"pdf_page": 96, "pdf_line": 15, "text": "始则权臣专制，政出私门；终乃鸩毒", "bbox": [14.22, 405.347, 305.271, 423.347], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3813, "char_end": 3829}
{"pdf_page": 96, "pdf_line": 16, "text": "潜加，享年不永。惜哉！", "bbox": [14.22, 432.887, 212.22, 450.887], "kind": "paragraph", "char_start": 3829, "char_end": 3840}
